bit is reg with its packed width: 1
byte shortint longint and int map to their sizes: 1
an untyped enum is integer 32: 1
a typed enum uses its declared type: 1
shortreal maps to real: 1
packed arrays and structures are one reg vector: 1
uwire maps to wire: 1
the unpacked array is not dumped: 1
every var type is an IEEE 1364-2005 type: 1
